==Northern Sami==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-pro|se}} {{recons|ńeljä|lang=fiu-pro}}. Cognates include Estonian {{term|neli|lang=et}}, Finnish {{term|neljä|lang=fi}}, and Hungarian {{term|négy|lang=hu}}.

